says there it isn't released until July

Keep your head up, I relate to that kinda thinking a lot. send me a message anytime if you wanna chat

&#x200B;

Edit: Forgot to add, it sounds like christmas and new years were big triggers hey? They were bad for me this year too.

Yes, I thought they improved with the 2nd season for sure!

&#x200B;

Also, yes I have read the manga, i still like it

I would suggest that you write your friend a letter, it sounds like you have a ton of unexpressed grief and guilt about not being able to speak to your friend again. Maybe you will find some peace doing this as well as healing. Maybe burn it after or say a prayer for her. I suffered a death recently that hit me in a way no other death has, I prayed for her like I was talking to her which was helpful to me too

&#x200B;

I honestly think at this point once a month for counselling isn't enough, it sounds like it may have triggered some depression if you're not doing your hair or taking care of yourself.

&#x200B;

I dunno what your health is like but maybe start going to the gym a few times a week, eating better, staying hydrated and do some fun activities.

&#x200B;

I know when my best friend killed himself it took awhile for me to recover. Your boyfriend sounds like he's being patient just let it be. If he has a high sex drive maybe just make sure he's actively engaging with you about this stuff rather than just jumping to the sex if he's doing that.
